Failure mode names and the three-category structure come from the MAST
taxonomy in Cemri et al., "Why Do Multi-Agent LLM Systems Fail?"
(NeurIPS 2025), https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.13657
The short descriptions in this repository are paraphrases, not the paper text.

The targeted-repair split (keep finished siblings, replan the failed leaf)
is inspired by HTN-Orchestrate, https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22195
